mw2coop patch for maps/_blizzard.gsc (Cliffhanger, Modern Warfare 2, 64-bit Steam build)

1. In co-op the blizzard effect is played on each player's "tag_origin", which campaign
   players do not have (no body model): the call fails and the blizzard thread dies on both
   machines. Play it on a tag_origin model that follows the player instead.
@@@ replace
blizzard_start_proc()
{
	while ( 1 )
	{
		if ( is_coop() )
			PlayFXOnTagForClients( level._effect[ "blizzard_main" ], self, "tag_origin", self );
@@@ with
blizzard_start_proc()
{
	fx_ent = self;
	if ( maps\_mw2coop::is_campaign_coop() )
		fx_ent = self maps\_mw2coop::player_tag_ent();
	while ( 1 )
	{
		if ( is_coop() )
			PlayFXOnTagForClients( level._effect[ "blizzard_main" ], fx_ent, "tag_origin", self );
@@@ end

2. The frost on the screen (overlay_frozen, blizzard_overlay_alpha / blizzard_overlay_clear) went to player 1 alone when the level turned
   the blizzard on or off (called on the level: so_snowrace_code, so_sabotage_cliffhanger_code, the campaign's transitions): player 2's
   view never froze over (Spec Ops audit 2026-11-17, item 1.6). Called on the level, they now do it for each player (each fade starts
   from the level's previous alpha, as player 1's did).
@@@ replace
blizzard_overlay_alpha( time, alpha, skipCap )
{
	player = self;
	if ( !isplayer( player ) )
		player = level.player;
@@@ with
blizzard_overlay_alpha( time, alpha, skipCap )
{
	if ( !isplayer( self ) && isdefined( level.players ) && level.players.size > 1 )
	{
		mw2coop_start = level.blizzard_overlay_alpha;
		foreach ( mw2coop_player in level.players )
		{
			level.blizzard_overlay_alpha = mw2coop_start;
			mw2coop_player blizzard_overlay_alpha( time, alpha, skipCap );
		}
		return;
	}
	player = self;
	if ( !isplayer( player ) )
		player = level.player;
@@@ end
@@@ replace
		player = self;
		if ( !isplayer( player ) )
			player = level.player;
		overlay = get_frozen_overlay( player );
		overlay destroy();
		return;
@@@ with
		if ( !isplayer( self ) && isdefined( level.players ) && level.players.size > 1 )
		{
			foreach ( mw2coop_player in level.players )
			{
				mw2coop_overlay = get_frozen_overlay( mw2coop_player );
				mw2coop_overlay destroy();
			}
			return;
		}
		player = self;
		if ( !isplayer( player ) )
			player = level.player;
		overlay = get_frozen_overlay( player );
		overlay destroy();
		return;
@@@ end
